#: ../../openmvcam/shields/touch-lcd-shield.rst:77
msgid ""
"Drive the backlight via PWM for adjustable brightness. Wrap "
":class:`machine.PWM` in a small backlight controller class and pass it to "
":class:`~display.SPIDisplay` through its ``backlight`` argument — "
":class:`~display.SPIDisplay` calls ``backlight(value)`` on the object "
"whenever it needs to update the level::"
msgstr ""
"Kendalikan lampu latar melalui PWM untuk kecerahan yang dapat disesuaikan. "
"Bungkus :class:`machine.PWM` dalam kelas kontroler lampu latar kecil dan "
"teruskan ke :class:`~display.SPIDisplay` melalui argumen ``backlight``\\ "
"-nya — :class:`~display.SPIDisplay` memanggil ``backlight(value)`` pada "
"objek tersebut setiap kali perlu memperbarui level::"

